<workout_file>
	<author>Jarvis Chau (via TrainingPeaks)</author>
	<name>Anaerobic Sixteen</name>
	<description>One of TrainingPeaks Virtual&apos;s classic workouts:
Anaerobic Sixteen.

Perfect to recruit fast-twitch sprinting muscle fibres. After a solid warm-up, 16x 20 second explosive bursts, in four blocks of four. Simple, but effective.</description>
	<sportType>bike</sportType>
	<tags/>
	<workout>
		<Warmup Duration="600" PowerHigh="0.85" PowerLow="0.65">
			<textevent timeoffset="0" message="!TextEvents:{
10:Welcome to Anaerobic Sixteen;
20:This classic workout is perfect to recruit fast-twitch sprinting muscle fibres.;
30:Sixteen explosive bursts, in four blocks of four, with a focus on quality, not quantity.;
60:For now, focus on warming up, and getting your legs spinning.;
300:Half way through the warmup.;
540:1 minute to go.;
}"/>
		</Warmup>
		<IntervalsT Repeat="4" OnDuration="100" OnPower="0.5" OffDuration="20" OffPower="2">
			<textevent timeoffset="0" message="!TextEvents:{
0:First, a short rest before we start the first interval;
80:Get ready, here we go!;
100:Go Go Go;
120:One done.
Now focus on recovery;
220:Go Go Go;
240:Two done.
Now focus on recovery;
340:Go Go Go;
360:Three done.
Now focus on recovery;
460:Go Go Go;
}"/>
			<textevent timeoffset="120" message="!TextEvents:{
